<title>USA: Ambac qualifies six muni bond issue for insurance.</title>
<headline>Ambac qualifies six muni bond issue for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambac Assurance Corp on Tuesday said it qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal issues slated for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Alaska, Certificates of Participaton, $5.995 million.</p>
<p>--Washington Elementary School District #6, Ariz., School Improvement, $34.825 million.</p>
<p>--Florida State Board Of Regent, Revenues, $45.395 million.</p>
<p>--Gloucester, Mass., General Obligations (GOs), $14.575 million.</p>
<p>--Park Ridge, N.J., General Improvement, $2.935 million.</p>
<p>--Corning City, N.Y., School District, $3.5 million.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
